\"name\": \"Brightluxx\", \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com\", \"logo\": \"https://files.ihgbrands.com/uploads_hero_banner.webp\"}, \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com/products/bl-sky390\", \"category\": \"ceiling-led\", \"image\": \"https://files.ihgbrands.com/brightluxx/site-images/prod_bl-sky390.webp\", \"offers\": {\"@type\": \"AggregateOffer\", \"priceCurrency\": \"USD\", \"lowPrice\": 1500, \"highPrice\": 10000, \"offerCount\": 1, \"availability\": \"https://schema.org/InStock\", \"seller\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"Brightluxx\", \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com\", \"logo\": \"https://files.ihgbrands.com/uploads_hero_banner.webp\"}, \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com/products/bl-sky390\"}, \"additionalProperty\": [{\"@type\": \"PropertyValue\", \"name\": \"Pixel Pitch\", \"value\": \"3.91mm\"}, {\"@type\": \"PropertyValue\", \"name\": \"Brightness\", \"value\": \"2,000 nits\"}, {\"@type\": \"PropertyValue\", \"name\": \"Resolution\", \"value\": \"256 x 128 per panel\"}, {\"@type\": \"PropertyValue\", \"name\": \"Warranty\", \"value\": \"3 Years Standard | 5 Years Extended Available\"}]}14:Tc91,{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What is the pixel pitch of the SkyScreen 3.9mm and why is it important?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"The SkyScreen 3.9mm has a pixel pitch of 3.91mm, which ensures high-resolution, sharp images ideal for close viewing distances typical in indoor ceiling installations. This fine pitch delivers vibrant and detailed visuals for immersive experiences.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"How is the SkyScreen 3.9mm installed and what orientation does it support?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"The display is designed for overhead ceiling mounting, providing a seamless LED canopy effect. Its lightweight aluminium frame and manageable panel size of 500x500mm simplify installation and maintenance in various commercial environments.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What level of brightness does this LED display provide?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"With a brightness rating of 2,000 nits, the SkyScreen 3.9mm offers excellent visibility in brightly lit indoor settings like shopping malls and airport terminals, ensuring clear and vibrant content display throughout the day.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What warranty and after-sales support does Brightluxx offer for this product?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Brightluxx provides a comprehensive warranty and dedicated after-sales support for the SkyScreen 3.9mm, ensuring product reliability and customer satisfaction. Specific warranty terms can be discussed during the purchase process.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"How does the SkyScreen 3.9mm compare to larger pixel pitch ceiling LED solutions?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Compared to larger pixel pitch displays, the 3.9mm pitch delivers finer image quality and better detail, crucial for close-proximity viewing on ceilings. It balances brightness and resolution for optimal performance in premium indoor environments.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What are the typical power consumption and maintenance requirements?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"The display consumes an average of 280W per square meter, which is energy-efficient for its brightness class. Its robust IP43 rating protects against dust and moisture, while the aluminium frame enhances durability, reducing maintenance needs.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Can the SkyScreen 3.9mm display dynamic content such as wayfinding and animations?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Yes, it is designed to showcase dynamic content including animated skies, digital art, and wayfinding information, enabling vibrant, interactive ceiling experiences that engage visitors and enhance spatial navigation.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Is the display suitable for use in outdoor or high-humidity environments?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"The SkyScreen 3.9mm has an IP43 rating, making it suitable for indoor environments exposed to moderate humidity and dust but not for outdoor or wet locations. It's best deployed in controlled indoor spaces like malls and airports.\"}}]}9:[\"$\",\"main\",null,{\"data-testid\":\"next-server-rendered-parity-page\",\"children\":[[[\"$\",\"script\",\"0\",{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"$13\"}}],[\"$\",\"script\",\"1\",{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"$14\"}}],\"$L15\",\"$L16\",\"$L17\"],\"$L18\"]}]\n15:[\"$\",\"script\",\"2\",{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"{\\\"@context\\\": \\\"https://schema.org\\\", \\\"@type\\\": \\\"BreadcrumbList\\\", \\\"itemListElement\\\": [{\\\"@type\\\": \\\"ListItem\\\", \\\"position\\\": 1, \\\"name\\\": \\\"Home\\\", \\\"item\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com\\\"}, {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"ListItem\\\", \\\"position\\\": 2, \\\"name\\\": \\\"Products\\\", \\\"item\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com/products\\\"}, {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"ListItem\\\", \\\"position\\\": 3, \\\"name\\\": \\\"SkyScreen 3.9mm\\\", \\\"item\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com/products/bl-sky390\\\"}]}\"}}]\n16:[\"$\",\"script\",\"3\",{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"{\\\"@context\\\": \\\"https://schema.org\\\", \\\"@type\\\": \\\"Organization\\\", \\\"@id\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com/#organization\\\", \\\"name\\\": \\\"Brightluxx\\\", \\\"legalName\\\": \\\"Brightluxx LED Displays\\\", \\\"url\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com\\\", \\\"logo\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com/android-chrome-512x512.png\\\", \\\"telephone\\\": \\\"+971559954274\\\", \\\"address\\\": {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"PostalAddress\\\", \\\"streetAddress\\\": \\\"Jebel Ali Industrial Area 1\\\", \\\"addressLocality\\\": \\\"Dubai\\\", \\\"addressCountry\\\": \\\"AE\\\"}, \\\"contactPoint\\\": {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"ContactPoint\\\", \\\"telephone\\\": \\\"+971559954274\\\", \\\"contactType\\\": \\\"sales\\\", \\\"areaServed\\\": [\\\"AE\\\", \\\"SA\\\", \\\"QA\\\", \\\"KW\\\", \\\"BH\\\", \\\"OM\\\"], \\\"availableLanguage\\\": [\\\"en\\\", \\\"ar\\\"]}}\"}}]\n17:[\"$\",\"script\",\"4\",{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"{\\\"@context\\\": \\\"https://schema.org\\\", \\\"@type\\\": \\\"LocalBusiness\\\", \\\"@id\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com/#localbusiness\\\", \\\"name\\\": \\\"Brightluxx LED Displays\\\", \\\"image\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com/android-chrome-512x512.png\\\", \\\"url\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com\\\", \\\"telephone\\\": \\\"+971559954274\\\", \\\"priceRange\\\": \\\"AED 2,500 - AED 12,000 per m\\\\u00b2\\\", \\\"address\\\": {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"PostalAddress\\\", \\\"streetAddress\\\": \\\"Jebel Ali Industrial Area 1\\\", \\\"addressLocality\\\": \\\"Dubai\\\", \\\"addressCountry\\\": \\\"AE\\\"}, \\\"geo\\\": {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"GeoCoordinates\\\", \\\"latitude\\\": 24.9857, \\\"longitude\\\": 55.0272}, \\\"openingHoursSpecification\\\": {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"OpeningHoursSpecification\\\", \\\"dayOfWeek\\\": [\\\"Monday\\\", \\\"Tuesday\\\", \\\"Wednesday\\\", \\\"Thursday\\\", \\\"Friday\\\", \\\"Saturday\\\"], \\\"opens\\\": \\\"09:00\\\", \\\"closes\\\": \\\"18:00\\\"}, \\\"areaServed\\\": [\\\"Dubai\\\", \\\"Abu Dhabi\\\", \\\"United Arab Emirates\\\", \\\"Saudi Arabia\\\", \\\"Qatar\\\", \\\"Kuwait\\\", \\\"Bahrain\\\", \\\"Oman\\\"]}\"}}]\n19:T702,<h1>SkyScreen 3.9mm</h1><p>Explore SkyScreen 3.9mm LED display in Dubai with Brightluxx. Ideal for indoor &amp; outdoor use. Call for premium LED solutions in the UAE!</p><p><strong>Look up. The ceiling is alive.</strong></p><p>Overhead LED canopy display transforming ceilings into dynamic digital skies. Lightweight aluminium frame with IP43 protection. Creates immersive experiences in shopping malls, hotel lobbies, and airport terminals. Content includes animated skies, art, and wayfinding.</p><h2>FAQ</h2><h3>What is the pixel pitch of the SkyScreen 3.9mm and why is it important?</h3><p>The SkyScreen 3.9mm has a pixel pitch of 3.91mm, which ensures high-resolution, sharp images ideal for close viewing distances typical in indoor ceiling installations. This fine pitch delivers vibrant and detailed visuals for immersive experiences.</p><h3>How is the SkyScreen 3.9mm installed and what orientation does it support?</h3><p>The display is designed for overhead ceiling mounting, providing a seamless LED canopy effect. Its lightweight aluminium frame and manageable panel size of 500x500mm simplify installation and maintenance in various commercial environments.</p><h3>What level of brightness does this LED display provide?</h3><p>With a brightness rating of 2,000 nits, the SkyScreen 3.9mm offers excellent visibility in brightly lit indoor settings like shopping malls and airport terminals, ensuring clear and vibrant content display throughout the day.</p><h3>What warranty and after-sales support does Brightluxx offer for this product?</h3><p>Brightluxx provides a comprehensive warranty and dedicated after-sales support for the SkyScreen 3.9mm, ensuring product reliability and customer satisfaction. Specific warranty terms can be discussed during the purchase process.</p>18:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"$19\"}}]\nf:[[\"$\",\"meta\",\"0\",{\"charSet\":\"utf-8\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"1\",{\"name\":\"viewport\",\"content\":\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\"}]]\nc:null\n11:[[\"$\",\"title\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"SkyScreen 3.9mm LED Display - Brightluxx Dubai Premium\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"1\",{\"name\":\"description\",\"content\":\"Explore SkyScreen 3.9mm LED display in Dubai with Brightluxx. Ideal for indoor & outdoor use. Call for premium LED solutions in the UAE!\"}],[\"$\",\"link\",\"2\",{\"rel\":\"canonical\",\"href\":\"https://brightluxx.com/products/bl-sky390\"}]]\n","/$c$slug/__PAGE__":"1:\"$Sreact.fragment\"\n2:T5d2,{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"Product\", \"name\": \"SkyScreen 3.9mm\", \"description\": \"Overhead LED canopy display transforming ceilings into dynamic digital skies. Lightweight aluminium frame with IP43 protection. Creates immersive experiences in shopping malls, hotel lobbies, and airport terminals. Content includes animated skies, art, and wayfinding.\", \"sku\": \"BL-SKY390\", \"brand\": {\"@type\": \"Brand\", \"name\": \"Brightluxx\"}, \"manufacturer\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"Brightluxx\", \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com\", \"logo\": \"https://files.ihgbrands.com/uploads_hero_banner.webp\"}, \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com/products/bl-sky390\", \"category\": \"ceiling-led\", \"image\": \"https://files.ihgbrands.com/brightluxx/site-images/prod_bl-sky390.webp\", \"offers\": {\"@type\": \"AggregateOffer\", \"priceCurrency\": \"USD\", \"lowPrice\": 1500, \"highPrice\": 10000, \"offerCount\": 1, \"availability\": \"https://schema.org/InStock\", \"seller\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"Brightluxx\", \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com\", \"logo\": \"https://files.ihgbrands.com/uploads_hero_banner.webp\"}, \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com/products/bl-sky390\"}, \"additionalProperty\": [{\"@type\": \"PropertyValue\", \"name\": \"Pixel Pitch\", \"value\": \"3.91mm\"}, {\"@type\": \"PropertyValue\", \"name\": \"Brightness\", \"value\": \"2,000 nits\"}, {\"@type\": \"PropertyValue\", \"name\": \"Resolution\", \"value\": \"256 x 128 per panel\"}, {\"@type\": \"PropertyValue\", \"name\": \"Warranty\", \"value\": \"3 Years Standard | 5 Years Extended Available\"}]}3:Tc91,{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What is the pixel pitch of the SkyScreen 3.9mm and why is it important?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"The SkyScreen 3.9mm has a pixel pitch of 3.91mm, which ensures high-resolution, sharp images ideal for close viewing distances typical in indoor ceiling installations. This fine pitch delivers vibrant and detailed visuals for immersive experiences.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"How is the SkyScreen 3.9mm installed and what orientation does it support?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"The display is designed for overhead ceiling mounting, providing a seamless LED canopy effect. Its lightweight aluminium frame and manageable panel size of 500x500mm simplify installation and maintenance in various commercial environments.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What level of brightness does this LED display provide?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"With a brightness rating of 2,000 nits, the SkyScreen 3.9mm offers excellent visibility in brightly lit indoor settings like shopping malls and airport terminals, ensuring clear and vibrant content display throughout the day.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What warranty and after-sales support does Brightluxx offer for this product?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Brightluxx provides a comprehensive warranty and dedicated after-sales support for the SkyScreen 3.9mm, ensuring product reliability and customer satisfaction. Specific warranty terms can be discussed during the purchase process.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"How does the SkyScreen 3.9mm compare to larger pixel pitch ceiling LED solutions?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Compared to larger pixel pitch displays, the 3.9mm pitch delivers finer image quality and better detail, crucial for close-proximity viewing on ceilings. It balances brightness and resolution for optimal performance in premium indoor environments.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What are the typical power consumption and maintenance requirements?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"The display consumes an average of 280W per square meter, which is energy-efficient for its brightness class. Its robust IP43 rating protects against dust and moisture, while the aluminium frame enhances durability, reducing maintenance needs.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Can the SkyScreen 3.9mm display dynamic content such as wayfinding and animations?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Yes, it is designed to showcase dynamic content including animated skies, digital art, and wayfinding information, enabling vibrant, interactive ceiling experiences that engage visitors and enhance spatial navigation.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Is the display suitable for use in outdoor or high-humidity environments?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"The SkyScreen 3.9mm has an IP43 rating, making it suitable for indoor environments exposed to moderate humidity and dust but not for outdoor or wet locations. It's best deployed in controlled indoor spaces like malls and airports.\"}}]}a:X\nf:X\nf:C\n0:{\"buildId\":\"d59rBE55FstXJAjtgGQzt\",\"data\":[{\"rsc\":[\"$\",\"$1\",\"c\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"main\",null,{\"data-testid\":\"next-server-rendered-parity-page\",\"children\":[[[\"$\",\"script\",\"0\",{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"$2\"}}],[\"$\",\"script\",\"1\",{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"$3\"}}],\"$L4\",\"$L5\",\"$L6\"],\"$L7\"]}],null,\"$L8\"]}],\"isPartial\":\"$@9\",\"staleTime\":\"$a\",\"varyParams\":null},{\"rsc\":\"$Lb\",\"isPartial\":\"$@c\",\"staleTime\":\"$a\",\"varyParams\":null},{\"rsc\":\"$Ld\",\"isPartial\":\"$@e\",\"staleTime\":\"$a\",\"varyParams\":\"$f\"},{\"rsc\":\"$L10\",\"isPa